notes: |
  Runtime supported by the RoadmapBench OpenClaw adapter.
  OpenClaw v2026.9.2 already contains native rolling tool-loop detection and
  the post-compaction loop guard, so the Agent_Bench v2026.4.22 loop-guard
  backport must not be reapplied to this runtime.
  Apply v2026_9_2_patch.py to an extracted runtime tree and run it again with
  --verify-only before packaging the runtime image.
